. 
. *--------------------------------------------------------------
. * A flow network over the same subnets
. *
. * The share of the edge in what leaves its node, scaled by the
. * share of the subnet itself. Both frames are written: the subnet
. * weights and their sum.
. *--------------------------------------------------------------
. 
